---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import DataLineTemplate from '../components/DataLineTemplate.astro';
---

<Base title="The data line: what may go into which tool | StoryaConsulting" description="A one-page template for the written rule on what may go into which AI tool. The rule we write first on every engagement." path="/data-line/">
<div class="pagehead">
    <p class="eyebrow">One-page template</p>
    <h1>A written rule, <em>short enough to follow.</em></h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>This is the rule we write first on every engagement, before anything is built. It fits on one page. Use it as it stands or change it to fit your firm, and write down who owns it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <DataLineTemplate />

  <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:2.4rem">
    <a class="btn" href="/start">Tell us what stalled</a>
    <span class="cta-row__aside">If the rule is the easy part and getting people to follow it is the hard part, that is the conversation to have.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn btn--quiet" href="/">Back to the site</a>
  </div>
</Base>
